{"overview":"مارفل، دختر یک کارآفرین اسپانیایی قدرتمند، زندگی‌اش را در نیویورک وقتی می‌بیند که دستگیر می‌شود و بدون توضیح رها می‌شود، به‌صورت کاملاً معکوس می‌بیند. پدرش سابستین مور را به‌عنوان نگهبان استخدام می‌کند و مجبور می‌شود هر لحظه را با او بگذرانند؛ در دنیایی که هیچ چیز همان‌طور که به نظر می‌رسد نیست، کشش ناگزیر بین آن‌ها شعله‌ور می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Marfil, daughter of a powerful Spanish businessman, sees her life in New York turned upside down when she is kidnapped and released without explanation. Her father hires Sebastian Moore as bodyguard and, forced to spend every minute together, an inevitable attraction ignites in a world where nothing is as it seems.","tagline_en":"","runtime":104,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Óscar Pedraza"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["ES"],"cast":[{"name":"استر اکسپوزیتو","role":"Marfil","photo":"/xoktRKmZQbNokVRIk9Ff1XJXMEg.jpg","en":"Ester Expósito"},{"name":"Hugo Diego Garcia","role":"Sebastian","photo":"/mC0Aly8hHgNIYvZSa1SZmYU47pn.jpg"},{"name":"Pablo Molinero","role":"Alejandro Cortés","photo":"/mtoRws2DEpETuGJGmvI5DALUcce.jpg"},{"name":"Lluís Homar","role":"Logan","photo":"/p1AFBzyZRbHzA6S8q3RWw0YXoAf.jpg"},{"name":"Joaquín Ferreira","role":"Ray","photo":"/dGpDGDPMtvsZpc4ZMMgjy1DOGpU.jpg"},{"name":"Zoe Bonafonte","role":"Gabriela","photo":"/pwjNbRQP4GXVREfB96SuzHh2hqq.jpg"},{"name":"Majo Gámez","role":"Tami","photo":"/zjgbcRy2IQH30AySeXa3H0MkUUZ.jpg"},{"name":"João Bettencourt","role":"Liam","photo":"/a0wqnZmewxpNIXi1ol9fii2CzWJ.jpg"},{"name":"Leander Vyvey","role":"Wilson","photo":"/dTKoYDKqU8vPx7tzbOEcjHKeYRb.jpg"},{"name":"Eric Masip","role":"Iván","photo":"/2JmF1hJ40a3k3oyeiAoITiX1CKI.jpg"},{"name":"Luka Peroš","role":"Marcus Kozel","photo":"/lfh7959EpR9gAvrjObNGXaUg2qF.jpg"},{"name":"Inge Ladd","role":"Profesora Fonteyn","photo":"/2dM7bk6nAKPzLLOlYs2EBoeVMIm.jpg"}],"trailer":"WlGzP8FvsfY","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1440098-enfrentados-marfil/watch